ClariBite is an AI-powered food transparency app that not only decodes complex food labels into simple language but also ensures seamless access even in low-connectivity environments. By implementing a smart caching system, ClariBite stores critical food information locally on users’ devices, allowing parents and kids to continue learning and making healthy choices even when the internet drops. Once the connection is restored, the app refreshes within 30 seconds to deliver the latest verified data from trusted sources like FSSAI and WHO.

This redesign bridges the awareness gap in real-time, ensuring families never lose access to essential food safety insights — whether online or offline.
